        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Only 10 lives. 90 handcrafted levels. One brutal challenge.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collector: 10 Lives Challenge is a distilled arcade-puzzle experience built entirely around <strong>mastery and survival</strong>. You start with just 10 lives — and that’s all you’ll ever get. Lose them all, and it’s back to the very beginning. No extra continues. No shortcuts. Just pure challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is simple: guide a small crystal orb along intricate paths and <strong>collect every gold piece in each level</strong>. The moment all gold is collected, the level ends. But one wrong click, one mistimed jump, and you’re out. With every mistake, your precious pool of lives shrinks. Can you survive all 90 levels in a single run?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10 Lives Total</strong> – A single pool of lives for the entire game. Run out, and it’s game over.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>90 Handcrafted Levels</strong> – From introductory stages to near-impossible final trials.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple Controls, Impossible Difficulty</strong> – One button, infinite ways to fail.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Variety of Challenges</strong> – Time-limited stages, move-limited puzzles, disappearing platforms, moving hazards, portals, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pause &amp; Resume</strong> – Take a break, but when you return, your remaining lives and progress are exactly where you left them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaderboards &amp; Achievements</strong> – Compete globally: who gets furthest, with the most lives, in the fastest time?</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why Play?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collector: 10 Lives Challenge is not about grinding, upgrades, or random luck. It’s about <strong>learning patterns, refining your timing, and pushing your limits</strong> until you finally conquer the impossible. Each run is a test of focus and resilience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ten lives. One chance. Can you beat the challenge?</strong></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Only 10 lives. 90 handcrafted levels. One brutal challenge.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collector: 10 Lives Challenge is a distilled arcade-puzzle experience built entirely around <strong>mastery and survival</strong>. You start with just 10 lives — and that’s all you’ll ever get. Lose them all, and it’s back to the very beginning. No extra continues. No shortcuts. Just pure challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is simple: guide a small crystal orb along intricate paths and <strong>collect every gold piece in each level</strong>. The moment all gold is collected, the level ends. But one wrong click, one mistimed jump, and you’re out. With every mistake, your precious pool of lives shrinks. Can you survive all 90 levels in a single run?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10 Lives Total</strong> – A single pool of lives for the entire game. Run out, and it’s game over.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>90 Handcrafted Levels</strong> – From introductory stages to near-impossible final trials.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple Controls, Impossible Difficulty</strong> – One button, infinite ways to fail.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Variety of Challenges</strong> – Time-limited stages, move-limited puzzles, disappearing platforms, moving hazards, portals, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pause &amp; Resume</strong> – Take a break, but when you return, your remaining lives and progress are exactly where you left them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaderboards &amp; Achievements</strong> – Compete globally: who gets furthest, with the most lives, in the fastest time?</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why Play?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collector: 10 Lives Challenge is not about grinding, upgrades, or random luck. It’s about <strong>learning patterns, refining your timing, and pushing your limits</strong> until you finally conquer the impossible. Each run is a test of focus and resilience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ten lives. One chance. Can you beat the challenge?</strong></p>",
